Please keep the relative paths for all files the same. Data will automatically be read form the current directory

Code must be ran in a Linux distibution.


For OpenMP
Compile: g++ -O2 -fopenmp -o openmp openmp.cpp
Run: ./openmp N
* Where N is the number of threads

For C++ threads
Compile: g++ -O2 -o cppthreads cppthreads.cpp
Run: ./cppthreads N
* Where N is the number of threads

For MPI
Compile: mpic++ -o mpi mpi.cpp
Run: mpirun -np N ./mpi
* Where N is the number of threads

For verification
Compile: g++ -O2 -o verify verify.cpp
Run: ./verify FILE1 File2
* Where FILE1 is the relative path the the first text file you want to compare and FILE2 is the relative path the the second text file you want to compare